@startuml USLP10 - System Sequence Diagram

autonumber
actor "Traffic Manager" as Manager
participant ":System" as System

activate Manager

' 1. Start Dispatch
Manager -> System : selects "Dispatch & Schedule Train"
activate System
System --> Manager : requests Train ID
deactivate System

' 2. ID Input
Manager -> System : enters Train ID (e.g., "5437")
activate System
System --> Manager : requests Operation Mode (1-Auto, 2-Manual)
deactivate System

' 3. Mode Input & Processing
Manager -> System : selects Mode (e.g., "2 - Manual")
activate System

    note right of System
        1. Calls PL/SQL to retrieve Mass/Power
        2. Calls PL/SQL to retrieve Path Segments
        3. Calculates travel times iteratively
    end note

System --> Manager : displays Technical Header (Mass/Power)

loop for each segment in path

    System --> Manager : displays Station Arrival Time

    opt if Single Track Segment detected (in Manual Mode)
        System --> Manager : alerts "Single Line Ahead" & requests decision

        Manager -> System : selects decision (Wait / Proceed)

        System --> System : applies delay if "Wait" selected
        System --> Manager : confirms action
    end

end

System --> Manager : displays Final Schedule Completion
deactivate System

deactivate Manager
@enduml